Package: mint-server-base
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Linux Mint Server build <root@localhost>
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Depends: python3, perl, apt, aptitude, python3-apt, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, dconf-gsettings-backend | gsettings-backend, linuxmint-keyring, mint-mirrors, mint-upgrade-info, lsb-release, distro-info-data, psmisc, systemd
Provides: mint-info
Conflicts: mintsystem, mintupdate, mint-info-cinnamon, mint-info-mate, mint-info-xfce
Replaces: mintsystem, mintupdate, mint-info-cinnamon, mint-info-mate, mint-info-xfce
Description: Linux Mint Server base configuration and CLI tools
 Headless subset of Linux Mint's system tools for the Server edition:
  - Mint APT wrapper (/usr/local/bin/apt) and repository pinning
  - mintupdate-cli and mintupdate-automation (from mintupdate @MINTUPDATE_VERSION@)
  - apt helpers from mintsystem @MINTSYSTEM_VERSION@
  - /etc/linuxmint/info for the Server edition, GRUB and MOTD branding
  - snapd and graphical stack blocked from being pulled in by APT
